      "text": "Chunks can move with their particles.\nOmit “I / you / it” when context is clear.",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Chunks can move with their particles.\nOmit “I / you / it” when context is clear.",
