      "text": "The subject “you” comes from context.  か marks a polite question; casual questions often use rising intonation.",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The subject “you” comes from context.  か marks a polite question; casual questions often use rising intonation.",
